    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hope feels like such a lie at this point. like it's just something people say so they don't have to sit in the dark with you. every day is just the same cycle of watching him fade and feeling myself fade too. it's like we're both just waiting for the clock to run out, but i'm the one who has to stay awake to watch it happen. i just want everything to be still.",
